igible employees without dedicated parking."},{"kind":"permission","text":"Allow only employees without dedicated parking to claim an available space, assigning one available space on a first-come, first-served basis and displaying its allocated floor."},{"kind":"happy","text":"Make advance-scheduled releases and same-day releases before the daily release time claimable at the configured daily release time (default 8:00 AM); make same-day releases after that time claimable immediately."},{"kind":"data","text":"Record each successful claim with date, time, employee, and assigned parking; ensure a space can be claimed only once and update the available count."},{"kind":"error","text":"If no space remains when an employee attempts to claim, do not create an allocation and inform the employee that no parking is available; concurrent claim attempts must not allocate the same space twice."},{"kind":"happy","text":"Do not require the employee to select a specific space or enforce or verify that they park on the assigned floor."}],"id":"I-3","readingChosen":"Eligible employees without dedicated parking receive availability push notifications and compete to claim released spaces; the system assigns a space rather than letting a user choose one."},{"behaviours":[{"kind":"happy","text":"Have the entrance camera detect approaching cars and read their license plates; ignore pedestrians, motorcycles, and other non-car objects."},{"kind":"permission","text":"For a vehicle with a permanent parking sticker, leave entry to the existing process and do not require temporary-allocation verification, including when its holder released parking in the app."},{"kind":"happy","text":"For a vehicle without a permanent sticker, check the detected plate against valid temporary parking allocations for the current day."},{"kind":"happy","text":"When a no-sticker vehicle has a valid current-day temporary allocation, activate the green indicator and record the verification attempt, plate, time/date